// =============================================================================
// chora.tenancy.v1 — Tenant Mana Subsidy Pool events
// =============================================================================
//
// Source-of-truth: docs/architecture/adrs/adr-142-per-user-economy-mana.md
//   (Q2 = v1, tenant subsidy track)
//   + chora-contracts/openapi/tenancy-admin.yaml v1.2
//
// Owning domain : Tenancy + Billing (chora_tenancy database)
// Owning team   : Team 3 (Platform)
// Topic prefix  : chora.tenancy.tenant_mana_pool.*
//
// TenantManaPool is a tenant-funded prepaid mana balance used to
// subsidise per-learner Companion action costs (corporate L&D / cohort
// sponsorship use case). Pool funding hits the tenant's existing Stripe
// Customer; allocations debit the pool and (via Pub/Sub) credit the
// learner's per-user UserMana wallet (chora.identity.user_mana.credited.v1
// with reason=tenant_subsidy).
//
// Spend-order policy (per ADR-142): when a learner triggers
// ManaService.DeductMana, subsidy slices are drained FIRST in
// `expires_at ASC NULLS LAST`, `allocated_at ASC` order; personal
// balance is the overflow.
//
// EVERY event message embeds chora.common.v1.EventEnvelope as field 1.
// =============================================================================

